msgid "WAVE AIM Score"
msgstr "Puntaje WAVE AIM"

#: app/templates/report.html:37
msgid ""
"WAVE comparative score from 1 to 10 based on detectable errors, error "
"density, and alerts relative to the WebAIM Million sample. Higher is "
"better; it does not establish conformance."
msgstr ""
"Puntaje comparativo WAVE de 1 a 10 basado en errores detectables, "
"densidad de errores y alertas respecto a la muestra WebAIM Million. Un "
"valor mayor es favorable; no establece conformidad."

#: app/templates/report.html:38
msgid "Axe and WAVE taxonomies are not interchangeable"
msgstr "Las taxonomías Axe y WAVE no son intercambiables"

#: app/templates/report.html:38
msgid ""
"Axe Critical and WAVE Error can be inspected side by side as high-"
"priority evidence, as can Axe Moderate and WAVE Alert, but these are not "
"official severity mappings. WAVE Alert means that human review is needed;"
" WAVE Feature, Structure, and ARIA are informational categories rather "
"than failures."
msgstr ""
"Axe Critical y WAVE Error pueden inspeccionarse en paralelo como "
"evidencia prioritaria, al igual que Axe Moderate y WAVE Alert, pero no "
"son correspondencias oficiales de severidad. WAVE Alert indica que se "
"necesita revisión humana; WAVE Feature, Structure y ARIA son categorías "
"informativas, no fallos."

