#: app/templates/report.html:45
msgid "Primary coefficient: Spearman rho"
msgstr "Coeficiente principal: rho de Spearman"

#: app/templates/report.html:45
msgid ""
"Spearman is emphasized because accessibility measurements are counts, "
"bounded scores, and often non-normal or affected by outliers. Pearson r "
"is retained as a secondary sensitivity analysis for linear association. "
"Agreement between both coefficients strengthens the descriptive pattern; "
"disagreement suggests non-linearity, influential observations, or tied "
"ranks. Neither coefficient is an inferential conclusion by itself."
msgstr ""
"Se enfatiza Spearman porque las mediciones de accesibilidad son conteos, "
"puntajes acotados y suelen ser no normales o estar afectadas por valores "
"atípicos. Pearson r se conserva como análisis secundario de sensibilidad "
"para asociación lineal. La coincidencia entre ambos coeficientes refuerza"
" el patrón descriptivo; su desacuerdo sugiere no linealidad, "
"observaciones influyentes o rangos empatados. Ningún coeficiente "
"constituye por sí mismo una conclusión inferencial."

