msgstr "Clasificación entre herramientas"

#: app/templates/report.html:59
msgid ""
"Pages are ordered by their combined relative performance across Axe "
"issues, Lighthouse, and WAVE AIM."
msgstr ""
"Las páginas se ordenan por su desempeño relativo combinado en incidencias"
" Axe, Lighthouse y WAVE AIM."

#: app/templates/report.html:59
msgid ""
"Pages are ordered by their combined relative performance across Axe "
"issues and Lighthouse; WAVE was not required."
msgstr ""
"Las páginas se ordenan por su desempeño relativo combinado en incidencias"
" Axe y Lighthouse; WAVE no fue necesario."

#: app/templates/report.html:59
msgid ""
"The cross-tool ranking is not shown because fewer than three pages have "
"complete Axe and Lighthouse measurements."
msgstr ""
"La clasificación entre herramientas no se muestra porque menos de tres "
"páginas tienen mediciones completas de Axe y Lighthouse."

#: app/templates/report.html:61
msgid ""
"At least three pages with complete Axe issue and Lighthouse measurements "
"are required. WAVE AIM is added when it is available for every comparable"
" page, but WAVE is not required. With n < 3 the percentile scale is not "
"informative; specifically, at n = 2 ranks collapse to the endpoints 0 and"
" 100. Therefore the table, composite score, tool disagreement, and "
"calculation panel are intentionally omitted. For research studies, larger"
" samples remain preferable and this ranking should be interpreted as "
"descriptive and sample-relative."
msgstr ""
"Se requieren al menos tres páginas con mediciones completas de "
"incidencias Axe y Lighthouse. WAVE AIM se agrega cuando está disponible "
"para todas las páginas comparables, pero WAVE no es obligatorio. Con n < "
"3 la escala percentil no es informativa; específicamente, con n = 2 los "
"rangos se reducen a los extremos 0 y 100. Por ello se omiten "
"intencionalmente la tabla, el puntaje compuesto, el desacuerdo entre "
"herramientas y el panel de cálculo. Para estudios de investigación siguen"
" siendo preferibles muestras mayores y este ranking debe interpretarse "
"como descriptivo y relativo a la muestra."

#: app/templates/report.html:63
msgid "How to interpret it"
msgstr "Cómo interpretarlo"

#: app/templates/report.html:63
msgid ""
"The Cross-tool Composite Score is the equal-weighted mean of three "
"within-study percentile ranks: fewer Axe issues, higher Lighthouse, and "
"higher WAVE AIM are favorable. Tool disagreement is the range between "
"those three component percentiles; lower values indicate greater "
"convergence."
msgstr ""
"El Puntaje Compuesto entre Herramientas es la media con igual ponderación"
" de tres rangos percentiles dentro del estudio: menos incidencias Axe, un"
" Lighthouse mayor y un WAVE AIM mayor son favorables. El desacuerdo entre"
" herramientas es el rango entre esos tres percentiles componentes; "
"valores menores indican mayor convergencia."

#: app/templates/report.html:63
msgid ""
"The Cross-tool Composite Score is the equal-weighted mean of two within-"
"study percentile ranks: fewer Axe issues and higher Lighthouse are "
"favorable. WAVE is not required. Tool disagreement is the distance "
"between those two component percentiles; lower values indicate greater "
"convergence."
msgstr ""
"El Puntaje Compuesto entre Herramientas es la media con igual ponderación"
" de dos rangos percentiles dentro del estudio: menos incidencias Axe y un"
" Lighthouse mayor son favorables. WAVE no es obligatorio. El desacuerdo "
"entre herramientas es la distancia entre esos dos percentiles "
"componentes; valores menores indican mayor convergencia."

